 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Expressing physical pain",
     "texto": [
      "In Italian physical pain is expressed mainly with two structures: **Avere mal di + body part**: **Ho mal di testa** (I have a headache), **Ho mal di schiena** (I have a backache), **Ho mal di stomaco** (I have a stomachache).",
      "The other structure is **Mi fa male / Mi fanno male + noun**: **Mi fa male la gola** (my throat hurts), **Mi fanno male i denti** (my teeth hurt)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Agreement of fa male / fanno male",
     "texto": [
      "**Fa male** is used when the part that hurts is singular (*il braccio*, *la gamba*) and **fanno male** when it is plural (*le gambe*, *gli occhi*)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Structures for ailments",
     "columnas": [
